# Hunger Strikes (adoulin 76), the tie: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin with both quests available (The Starving's
# Timer 0); Adoulin fame level 1. Westerly Breeze: Hunger Strikes' 2530 and The Starving's 3005 are both progressEvents:
# they tie, the first talk plays the first in container order (Hunger Strikes'), finished: begun; the second talk the
# other one (alone at Progress), finished: begun. Both accepted (their accepted sections registered under Western
# Adoulin, user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs): Hunger Strikes' 2531 and The Starving's 3006, both events, tie: the
# first in container order, 2531. Both available again (GMs): the tie's cycle starts after the last action it played,
# 2531, which is not in this tie: from the first, 2530, finished: Hunger Strikes begun; then 3005, finished: The
# Starving begun.
lists WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2530 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/3005
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=63.5,32,123 job=WAR lvl=99
login
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # the tie: the first in container order: 2530
finish                                  # Hunger Strikes begun
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # The Starving's 3005, alone now
finish                                  # The Starving begun
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # both accepted: 2531 and 3006 tie: 2531
finish-if-event
quest Adoulin.HungerStrikes available   # a GM
quest Adoulin.TheStarving available     # a GM
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # the tie again: the last played, 2531, is not in it: 2530
finish                                  # Hunger Strikes begun
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 3005, alone now
finish                                  # The Starving begun
